[1748/1873] africa-rct
TITLE: AfricaRCT Observatory: Reproducibility Capsule for African Trial-Methods Audits
TYPE: methods  |  ESTIMAND: documentation proportion
DATA: Reviewer-facing capsule built from 388 source files, 1 tests, and 204 copied assets.
PATH: C:\Projects\africa-rct

